  "description": "Test build of Zaahen as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Zaahen so every damage instance on a champion stacks Determination (12 stacks, bonus attack each, doubled when full; the main pack: a coarser ladder), full Determination lets him revive from lethal damage (banished while he rises again, health coming back; the main pack: a shield), Aureate Rush has its own slot again - a dash and a spin whose outer edge hits harder and adds a share of maximum health (the main pack: a spin folded into Dreaded Return), and The Darkin Glaive heals a share of his maximum health (the main pack: a fixed heal). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
